  "description": "\"If you still feel guilty toward me, then choose me.” \n\nThe youngest daughter of the AE Group. An illegitimate child. A cripple. And… Snow White, Jeong Hamin, a woman with albinism. So fragile she seems as though she might shatter at a single touch— and then, he appears before her. Woo Jeongheon, the ill-fated soccer player whose life Hamin ruined ten years ago. Reappearing before her after a decade with a completely changed demeanor, Jeongheon proposes a contract marriage to Hamin… \n\n“If marriage isn’t possible, then at least keep me by your side for a while.” \n\n“Keep you by my side… for a while?” \n\n“You’re good at that, aren’t you? Keeping someone close, draining them dry, controlling them with just your fingertips. Hamin… do what you’re best at.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1811272801), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14244116), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Snow_White), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/desire_snow_white), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080235) \n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/195444)",
